  "decision_catalog": {
    "catalog_version": "catalog-mock-1",

    "_comment_catalog_values": "有限目录。**两个适配器（mock 与 rules）都必须从这份目录取值**——目录是契约，适配器只决定「怎么选」，不决定「能用哪些值」。这样就避免了「换个适配器就冒出新取值」这种违反有限类型决策的情况。`*-demo` 是 P0 就有的占位值，保留以兼容既有用例；`route-*` 等是 rules 适配器引入的语义化取值。",

    "routes": [
      "route-demo",
      "route-rules",
      "route-readonly-fast",
      "route-deep",
      "route-human"
    ],
    "actions": [
      "action-demo",
      "action-noop",
      "action-proceed",
      "action-require-approval",
      "action-escalate"
    ],
    "categories": [
      "category-demo",
      "category-readonly",
      "category-write",
      "category-high-risk"
    ],
    "reason_codes": [
      "reason-demo",
      "reason-rules-readonly-r0",
      "reason-rules-readonly-supervised",
      "reason-rules-write-needs-approval",
      "reason-rules-write-approved",
      "reason-rules-high-risk",
      "reason-rules-undetermined"
    ],
    "fallback_routes": ["fallback-demo", "route-human"],

    "_comment_catalog_source": "rules 适配器的判定依据来自登记表里**已有的**事实，不是新编的数据：`p1.classification.derived_origin_rules`（输入来源 → 数据等级）、`policies.risk_rules`（风险等级 → 是否需批准/可否自动）、`tools[*].read|write|risk_class`（工具能力与风险）。所以 rule_version 指向的是那两份规则各自的版本。",

    "_comment_decision_kinds": "上游 §3 给 Jev Decision Fabric 的封闭清单是 8 种：Route/Classify/Score/Rank/Filter/Gate/Select/Escalate（注意是 8 不是 9——我此前一直在口头说「九种」，数错了）。`implemented_decision_kinds` 是**本适配器**已实现的子集；请求未实现的类型必须**显式拒绝**，不得静默按 Route 返回（那会让调用方拿到一个看起来成功的错误答案）。**为什么只 4 种**：Score/Rank/Filter/Select 需要真实打分与排序依据，而上游 §8.2 要求「置信度是经独立数据校准的任务级指标，不能取 LLM 自报数字」——Mock 给不出有意义的数字，宁可拒绝也不假装。",
    "decision_kinds": [
      "Route",
      "Classify",
      "Score",
      "Rank",
      "Filter",
      "Gate",
      "Select",
      "Escalate"
    ],
    "implemented_decision_kinds": ["Route", "Classify", "Gate", "Escalate", "Score", "Filter"]
  },

  "decision_adapter": {
    "_comment": "上游 §16.1「Hermes/OpenClaw/Jev 版本、许可证、授权与升级策略」属待填依赖；§13「实际版本与 Hermes/Jev 适配方式需 P0 冻结」——本节点即那次冻结的落点。",
    "implementation": "mock",
    "config": {
      "confidence_source": "fixed-mock-constant",
      "confidence_calibrated": false
    },
    "_comment_switch": "换真实 Jev 时的步骤：① 写一个满足 packages/decision/adapter.py::DecisionAdapter 的类；② 在本节把 implementation 改成它的登记 id；③ 内核一行不改。若换实现仍需改内核，说明接口抽象不成立，应先把接口改对，而不是改内核。",
    "_registry_note": "未登记的实现 id **fail-closed 拒绝**，不退回 mock——否则生产配置写错时会静默用一个确定性 Mock 做决策，而调用方看不出区别。"
  },

